<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Conseco started by Dillon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Conseco started by Dillon.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Read said analyst Harry Radovich initiated coverage of Conseco Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Radovich estimates 1997 earnings at $2.65 a share and 1998 earnings at $3.25 a share.</p>
<p>-- He set a 12-18 month price target of $50.</p>
<p>-- Conseco was down 5/8 to 42-1/4 in late trading.</p>
</text>
